   "**The second death was in quarantine, which is the good news and the warning** — the direct effect is that the chain of transmission was already known when she died; the compound consequence is that a filovirus is contained by the completeness of the contact list, so the metric that matters is how many of the first patient's contacts were found before they developed symptoms, and that denominator has not been published",
   "**Bundibugyo still removes the vaccine playbook** — the direct effect is that ring vaccination, which contained Zaire outbreaks, cannot simply be copied; the compound consequence is that the response must be built from isolation, PPE, safe burial and tracing — labour-intensive, unexercised at scale in Kenya, and dependent on health workers who are themselves inside the cluster",
