   "**The two numbers in this story are the whole argument** — 161km/h then, above 400km/h now; the direct effect is that Ukrainian drones reach further than they did last week; the compound consequence is that a capability which changes a battlefield was gated by a parameter, so the next negotiation over this war will not be about territory but about throughput, and the party holding the parameter holds leverage no treaty recognises",
